cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these scripts, please cite the HiFiTaxa manuscript and this repository."
title: "HiFiTaxa_analysis: benchmark harness, scoring and figure code for the HiFiTaxa manuscript"
abstract: "Gadi job scripts, holdout splitters, scoring scripts and figure code used to benchmark the HiFiTaxa pipeline (https://github.com/alegarritano/HiFiTaxa) on the ATCC MSA-1003 16S rRNA gene mock, a 103 species fungal ITS mock and GTDB and UNITE leave 10% out holdouts, with the resulting tables and figures."
authors:
  - family-names: Garritano
    given-names: Alessandro N.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-20
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/alegarritano/HiFiTaxa_analysis"
